cyber-on-strata
===============

This repository is a fork of the Strata inference engine and contains
modifications made for running Cyber-Tiel-Coder-35B-A3B with a streamed
expert cache.  Third-party components and their licenses:

1. Strata (engine base)
   Upstream : https://github.com/Niko1221/Strata
   License  : MIT (see LICENSE)
   The upstream copyright notice is retained in LICENSE, unmodified.

2. ggml (vendored under third_party/ggml)
   License  : MIT (see third_party/ggml/LICENSE)

3. llama.cpp (build-time dependency; the released binary package bundles
   llama-tokenize.exe and its runtime DLLs for tokenization)
   Project  : https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp
   License  : MIT, Copyright (c) 2023-2026 The ggml authors

4. Model weights (NOT distributed by this repository)
   Model    : Cyber-Tiel-Coder-35B-A3B
   Source   : https://huggingface.co/peculiar-ragdoll/Cyber-Tiel-Coder-35B-A3B-GGUF-MTP
   License  : MIT (as declared by the model repository)
   Users must download the weights themselves.  Any derived artifact
   (expert pack, expert profile, tokenizer tables) generated by the tools in
   this repository from those weights is subject to the same MIT license.

